 "summary": "The new surjectivity lemmas for Grothendieck-group maps, `essSurj_lift_iff`, the generalized numerical-quotient equivalences and the Ext-Euler/q-Euler invariance results have no existing equivalent in Mathlib or TauCeti, and they reuse the existing naturality theorems and `Functor.essImage_\u03b9_comp`. The hand-written injectivity and surjectivity proofs could use Mathlib's `Submodule.ker_mapQ` and `Submodule.range_mapQ`, but they are short and don't clear the materiality bar.",
